@startuml selma_inspection_pipeline
' ============================================================
' Selma — Inspection Execution Pipeline
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §2.10–§2.13, §3.3, §3.6, §3.7
'          User_Stories.md S-10, S-15, S-16
' C4:      Rule Inspector → Snapshots Adapter → artifact_store
'          Rule Inspector → Lifecycle Finder (finding birth)
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Six pure stages. Reinspect = NEW inspection_id.
' Process FSM (not multi-day durable aggregate).
' Ownership / events / concurrency: README.md
' ============================================================

title Selma — Inspection Execution Pipeline\n<size:12><i>Six-stage pure evaluation · typed faults · immutable snapshot + HLC findings</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Submitted : <b>inspection.submit | reinspect</b>\nactor: Compliance Representative | System\n[capability: inspection.submit | inspection.reinspect]\nevent: InspectionSubmitted\nstory: S-10 / S-15

state "Submitted" as Submitted #B9770E : **entry** target payload received\n**allowed** ingress check only\n**forbidden** evaluate without pin
state "Ingress\nGranted" as IngressGranted #1B7A6E : **entry** capability + schema OK\n**allowed** set point-in-time pins\n**forbidden** mutate prior snapshots\npins: target_hash · cg_ir_snapshot_hash\nfrozen_env_hash · engine_version
state "Rejected\nIngress" as RejectedIngress #A93226 : **entry** 403 | SchemaError **terminal**\n**allowed** denial audit only\n**forbidden** snapshot · findings
state "1. Normalize" as Normalize #1B7A6E : **entry** NFC · UTC · IEEE 754\n**allowed** compute target_hash\n**forbidden** evaluator IO
state "2. Classify" as Classify #1B7A6E : **entry** target_type mapping\n**allowed** context enrichment\n**forbidden** finding birth
state "3. Select\nControls" as SelectControls #1B7A6E : **entry** scope filter CG-IR\n**allowed** deps ready · severity gate\n**forbidden** cascade on dependency fail
state "4. Evaluate" as Evaluate #1B7A6E : **entry** topological DAG pure evaluators\n**allowed** Pass|Fail|Partial|NeedsReview\nparallel independent nodes\n**forbidden** IO · randomness · env reads
state "5. Aggregate" as Aggregate #1B7A6E : **entry** deontic × outcome\n**allowed** conflict apply · severity map\n**forbidden** mutate CG-IR
state "6. Report" as Report #2C6E49 : **entry** append findings · write snapshot+trace\n**allowed** system_state_hash seal\n**forbidden** modify completed snapshot
state "Completed" as Completed #2C6E49 : **entry** status=completed **terminal**\n**allowed** read-only analytics\n**forbidden** mutate
state "Partial" as Partial #B9770E : **entry** status=partial · skipped_nodes\n**allowed** read-only · reinspect new id\n**forbidden** backfill skipped into same id
state "Failed" as Failed #A93226 : **entry** status=failed · fatal CG-IR\n**allowed** audit · reinspect new id\n**forbidden** partial publish as completed

Submitted --> IngressGranted : <b>grant</b>\nactor: System (Application Service)\n[capability_enforced at ingress]\nevent: InspectionIngressGranted
Submitted --> RejectedIngress : <b>deny</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionIngressDenied\naction: 403 | SchemaError · no snapshot

RejectedIngress --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

IngressGranted --> Normalize : <b>pin system_state inputs</b>\nactor: System (Rule Inspector)\ncommand: pin target_hash + cg_ir + frozen_env + engine\naction: system_state_hash inputs fixed\naction: event stream EXCLUDED from hash (§2.17)\nevent: InspectionPinned

Normalize --> Classify : <b>OK</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionStagePassed\naction: stage=normalize
Normalize --> Report : <b>fault → typed finding</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionStageFault\naction: Schema | Corruption

Classify --> SelectControls : <b>OK</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionStagePassed\naction: stage=classify
Classify --> Report : <b>fault → Schema</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionStageFault\naction: Schema

SelectControls --> Evaluate : <b>OK</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionStagePassed\naction: stage=select_controls
SelectControls --> Report : <b>Dependency skip</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionNodesSkipped\naction: skipped_nodes only · no finding

Evaluate --> Aggregate : <b>OK</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionStagePassed\naction: stage=evaluate
Evaluate --> Evaluate : <b>timeout retry</b>\nactor: System\n[retry_count < max_retries]\naction: infrastructure timeout only · max 3 · default 0\nevent: InspectionEvalRetry
Evaluate --> Report : <b>fault findings</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionStageFault\naction: Deterministic | Ambiguous | Timeout | Resource

Aggregate --> Report : <b>aggregate</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: OK or partial aggregate (always report)\nevent: InspectionAggregated

Report --> Completed : <b>seal completed</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: write snapshot + birth findings\nevent: InspectionCompleted\naction: FindingCreated for Fail|Partial|NeedsReview
Report --> Partial : <b>seal partial</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionPartial\naction: skipped_nodes present
Report --> Failed : <b>fatal CG-IR corruption</b>\nactor: System\nevent: InspectionFailed

Completed --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none
Partial --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none
Failed --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

@enduml
